# OGRS — DuckDNS updater configuration template.
#
# Copy this file to duckdns.conf and fill in real values. duckdns.conf
# is gitignored — your token never gets committed.
#
# To get the values:
#   1. Sign in at https://www.duckdns.org (Google / GitHub / Twitter / Reddit)
#   2. Pick a subdomain (e.g. "bh-ogrs") — that's DUCKDNS_DOMAINS
#   3. The page shows your token at the top — copy that as DUCKDNS_TOKEN
#
# Multiple subdomains? Comma-separate (no spaces): "bh-ogrs,alt-name"

DUCKDNS_DOMAINS="REPLACE_WITH_SUBDOMAIN_WITHOUT_DUCKDNS_ORG"
DUCKDNS_TOKEN="REPLACE_WITH_DUCKDNS_TOKEN_UUID"
